  </svg>
</section>

<!-- TIME DIFFERENCE MECHANICS -->
<section class="method-section" id="time-difference" aria-labelledby="time-diff-heading">
  <div class="method-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Time Difference Mechanics</p>
    <h2 id="time-diff-heading">Analyzing the 14-Hour Gap: WIT vs EST</h2>
    <p>
      The time difference between Eastern Indonesia Time (WIT, UTC+9) and Eastern Standard Time (EST, UTC-5) is <strong>14 hours</strong>. Calculating the difference: (+9) - (-5) = 14 hours total separation.
    </p>
    <p>
      When it is 12:00 PM (Noon) in Jayapura or Ambon, local time in New York or Miami is 10:00 PM on the <em>previous calendar day</em>. When it is 9:00 PM WIT in Eastern Indonesia, it corresponds to 7:00 AM EST in Eastern North America on the same day.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin: 2rem auto; max-width: 700px; padding: 1.5rem; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px;">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 600 180" width="100%" height="auto" style="display: block;">
      <rect width="600" height="180" fill="#0c354a" rx="8" />
      <g transform="translate(120, 90)">
        <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="50" fill="#12455d" stroke="#36c7b5" stroke-width="3" />
        <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="20" y2="12" stroke="#f4fbff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="-30" stroke="#36c7b5" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <text x="0" y="70" font-family="'Space Grotesk', sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="14" fill="#f4fbff" text-anchor="middle">WIT (UTC+9)</text>
      </g>
      <g transform="translate(300, 90)">
        <text x="0" y="8" font-family="'Space Grotesk', sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="28" fill="#36c7b5" text-anchor="middle">→</text>
        <rect x="-50" y="-30" width="100" height="24" rx="12" fill="#1b536e" />
        <text x="0" y="-14" font-family="'Manrope', sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="800" fill="#36c7b5" text-anchor="middle">-14 HOURS</text>
      </g>
      <g transform="translate(480, 90)">
        <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="50" fill="#12455d" stroke="#8fd7ff" stroke-width="3" />
        <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="-20" y2="20" stroke="#f4fbff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="-30" stroke="#8fd7ff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <text x="0" y="70" font-family="'Space Grotesk', sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="14" fill="#f4fbff" text-anchor="middle">EST (UTC-5)</text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="method-grid">
    <article class="method-card">
      <h3>14-Hour Offset Separation</h3>
      <p>WIT runs at UTC+9 year-round, while EST runs at UTC-5. The 14-hour gap means morning in Jayapura corresponds to the prior evening in New York.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="method-card">
      <h3>Daylight Shift Dynamics</h3>
      <p>When New York switches to Eastern Daylight Time (EDT, UTC-4) in summer, the offset decreases from 14 hours to 13 hours.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="method-card">
      <h3>WIT Evening / US Morning Window</h3>
      <p>The optimal window for live calls spans 9:00 PM – 11:00 PM WIT, matching 7:00 AM – 9:00 AM EST in Eastern North America.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 24-HOUR CONVERSION TABLE -->
<section class="examples-section" id="conversion-chart" aria-labelledby="chart-heading">
  <div>
    <h2 id="chart-heading">Complete 24-Hour WIT to EST Conversion Table</h2>
    <p>This reference grid maps every hour of Eastern Indonesia Time (WIT) directly to Eastern Standard Time (EST).</p>

    <!-- Timeline Graphic -->
    <div style="margin: 2rem auto; overflow-x: auto; background: var(--panel); padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;">WIT to EST Timeline Mapping</h3>
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 900 100" width="900" height="100" style="display: block;">
        <rect x="20" y="40" width="860" height="16" fill="#1b536e" rx="8" />
